  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3e132d12d28afaa8fe1a0006a2cfd96a5cd4463c.png\" alt=\"可自定义内容\" width=\"300\" height=\"100\">\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/respackopts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f1312f6cd1fb9e78c11fce62509ea94254428fb7.png\" alt=\"ResPackOpts 按钮\" width=\"220\" height=\"100\"></a>\n</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b79ab189af4417252a250cbb79c1b4bde1b808ef.png\" alt=\"Actually 3D Blocks &amp; Items 标志\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fmatej_sicha%252ftiers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a507cd406c0b46b1ec0fe3b7db36ef7c2b48c764.png\" alt=\"Ko-Fi 按钮\" width=\"180\" height=\"100\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e5bdc8ccb89415aa41070518c2c08da53c75ebdf.png\" alt=\"Puzzle 按钮\" width=\"180\" height=\"100\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252f5048Qu03\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/75fdc75ad59723d5409aac4ab98e56523d0ad46e.png\" alt=\"CurseForge 按钮\" width=\"52\" height=\"100\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modefite-item-definition-backport\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2782a154f927e6ea480e6340cb8098535df2ec36.png\" alt=\"Modefite 按钮\" width=\"180\" height=\"100\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/TJqmSYqyuu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/853614de62c5a1c45ac308af46b50e30aca91f8e.png\" alt=\"Discord 按钮\" width=\"180\" height=\"100\"></a>\n</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0ee9bd1ade57108cfa259a1e6cddf3ef1927301e.png\" alt=\"细线分隔符\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/9d33a27888960307d8f5ec924fbcbfcfbffd3cd3.png\" alt=\"描述第一部分\"></p>\n<span><span><iframe width=\"1120\" height=\"470\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/P8xNGLqy2hk\">\n</iframe></span></span>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/594997958beff874226a680f9aef61a1a5f95d6f.png\" alt=\"名称依赖变体\"></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/074fe6b5514cc7305bcd6c5ad5e53ba4e682cc44.png\" alt=\"名称依赖变体\">\n\n</div>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cbc65a80cfeda4ab5f9e3c226591efef5bdeeccc.png\" alt=\"战锤附魔变体\"></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/dffdeb30abc960704484a1038fbcb15d990b8fb4.png\" alt=\"该资源包为战锤添加了附魔依赖模型！（密度附魔系列图片）附魔变体相互叠加，共创造出 2880 种可能的组合！（火附魔、风爆和修复变体的图片）\">\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c1a6b97f286e75acbd3c28c677fe8503f286cd78.png\" alt=\"视频展示\">\n\n\n<span><span><iframe width=\"1120\" height=\"470\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/qyvepuPqWTc\">\n</iframe></span></span>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5e932efaf2b100136d487e03b5b9352d21ab9923.png\" alt=\"所有战锤变体\">\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b21b60dff4469c55f6427fa67392e032133d7f8b.png\" alt=\"只喜欢战锤？获取独立 3D 战锤资源包！\">\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/actually-3d-enchantment-mace\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/31ed037cfb314b68814e4c0f38c8f63b3f8e4f90.png\" alt=\"A3D 附魔战锤 按钮\" width=\"400\" height=\"100\"></a>\n</p>\n\n</div>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/9952c181a3555fe537afff46135838a1b7cca48d.png\" alt=\"随机化方块\"></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n\n\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/aed95af11b511b9f48170af215ef79e9f3d05f29.png\" alt=\"树叶斑块\">\n\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e36f17c9e2a80036dc7f6b3b59cf3d05e5571887.png\" alt=\"树叶斑块\">\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/25837e69b765490b27ed0de29509f9bcac474cc7.png\" alt=\"草与枯灌木\">\n\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/53db3994c07593dc15cef30850a2a2263e46c09d.png\" alt=\"草与枯灌木\">\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/342536fae6f07a37b587cbe74c70183fb8bafd4d.png\" alt=\"梯子\">\n\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/012db1bd28c8e659121e0aa0085ba998ce400c33.png\" alt=\"梯子\">\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d818e3df9f984a210c573832495928f612ca6dc2.png\" alt=\"书架\">\n\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7683617e24f138b47fb3d5e99db62c4d5283d402.png\" alt=\"书架\">\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5bcf4992ce72e9f46301ad14a746cadcab86e17f.png\" alt=\"苔藓悬垂\"></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2b2fb552a5cca93d458e6a1db995c00f01daf09b.png\" alt=\"苔藓悬垂\">\n\n</div>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0ee9bd1ade57108cfa259a1e6cddf3ef1927301e.png\" alt=\"细线分隔符\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f098ea24c9a88a6ccee116c406081cfa41abc47e.png\" alt=\"获取独立包\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/matt_crowberry/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b1b16792be12d8167463f733049125819b023647.png\" alt=\"实际上 3D 合集\" width=\"400\" height=\"100\"></a>\n</p>\n<p>‎ ‎ ‎ ‎ </p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/